* August 3rd - '''Monte''' part ways with [[rallen]] and sign [[DemQQ]] and [[KrizzeN]], with the latter joining as coach and manager. <ref name="+Woro2k">{{inside source|source=Woro2k}}</ref><ref name="+DemQQ +KrizzeN">{{inside source|source=KrizzeN}}</ref>
* September 15th - '''Monte''' sign [[Fessor]]. <ref name="+Fessor">{{inside source|source=KrizzeN}}</ref>
* October 11th - [[BOROS]] benches himself. <ref name="BOROS benched">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/boroscs/status/1579915453778268160|title=Won 2-0 vs @TeamBLINK_, thanks to Monte inviting to come play for them|date=2022-10-11|author=[[BOROS]]}}</ref>
* October 19th - '''Monte''' bench [[joel]]. <ref name="joel benched">{{inside source|source=KrizzeN}}</ref>
* November 11th - '''Monte''' sign [[kRaSnaL]]. <ref name="+kRaSnaL">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Monte_Esports/status/1591079000092209153|title=Roster update!|date=2022-11-11|author='''Monte'''}}</ref>
